tructions: <span class=\"bullet\">\nListen to the audio. </span> <span class=\"bullet\">\nRecord yourself saying the sentences aloud.</span>\n <span class=\"bullet\">\nCompare yourself to the audio.</span>"}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le10ob04re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le10ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le10ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le10ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey, Peter. Did you hear about John's relative?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, did something happen?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He called me a couple days ago. His cousin, Frank, was in a boating accident last summer.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? What happened?"}, {"time": "11750", "image": "engenn6le10ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Supposedly, he was fishing with his friend about 15 miles off Boston Harbor.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, the weather's been terrible lately. I hope he didn't get caught in that storm.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Their engine died, and his boat capsized ... and then suddenly there was a freak wave. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh gosh! How horrible for them. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah ... they had to spend the night clinging to the boat and waiting to be rescued. The water was freezing."}, {"time": "35250", "image": "engenn6le10ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How were they found?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: The Coast Guard spotted them with their helicopter. They were very lucky indeed.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: They're going to have to be more careful. They have to take some flares and a cell  phone.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Absolutely! They are going to have to tell people where they are going to fish next time as well. No one knew where they were.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's for sure! What a frightening experience!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}